  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The Local Planning Authority, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfied that sufficient evidence has been provided to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the property known as 56 Locket Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7NE has been in use as three self-contained flats for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application.",
    "Condition : 2 - The existing development is therefore immune from enforcement action under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) and is lawful under Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).",
